#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.groupby.rst:2
msgid "groupby"
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.groupby.groupby:1
msgid "Group tensor elements by group identifiers along a dimension."
msgstr "指定された次元に沿ってテンソル要素をグループ識別子でグループ化します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.groupby.groupby:3
msgid ""
"This function reorganizes elements of a tensor into groups based on "
"provided group identifiers. It creates a new dimension that contains all "
"elements belonging to each group. This is similar to SQL's GROUP BY or "
"pandas' groupby operation, but adapted for tensor operations."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、与えられたグループ識別子に基づいてテンソルの要素をグループに再編成します。各グループに属するすべての要素を含む新しい次元を作成します。これはSQLのGROUP"
" BY句やpandasのgroupby操作に似ていますが、テンソル演算用に最適化されています。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.groupby.groupby:8
msgid ""
"The function adds a new dimension immediately after the specified "
"dimension. This new dimension represents the items within each group. "
"Since tensors require fixed-size dimensions, groups with fewer elements "
"are padded with :attr:`empty_value`."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、指定された次元の直後に新しい次元を追加します。この新しい次元は各グループ内のアイテムを表します。テンソルの次元は固定サイズである必要があるため、要素数が少ないグループは"
" :attr:`empty_value` で埋められます。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.groupby.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.groupby.groupby:14
msgid "The input tensor to be grouped."
msgstr "グループ化する入力テンソル。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.groupby.groupby:17
msgid ""
"A 1D tensor of integer group identifiers with the same length as "
"``x.shape[dim]``. Each element specifies which group the corresponding "
"element in :attr:`x` belongs to. Group IDs should be non-negative "
"integers."
msgstr ""
"``x.shape[dim]``\\ と同じ長さの整数グループ識別子の1次元テンソル。各要素は、:attr:`x`\\ "
"の対応する要素が属するグループを指定します。グループIDは非負整数である必要があります。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.groupby.groupby:23
msgid ""
"The dimension along which to group elements. Default is -1 (the last "
"dimension)."
msgstr "要素をグループ化する次元。デフォルトは-1（最後の次元）です。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.groupby.groupby:27
msgid ""
"The value used to pad groups that have fewer elements than the maximum "
"group size. Default is ``nan``."
msgstr "グループサイズの最大値よりも要素数が少ないグループをパディングするために使用される値。デフォルトは ``nan`` です。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.groupby.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.groupby.groupby:32
msgid ""
"A tensor with one additional dimension compared to the input. The shape "
"is the same as :attr:`x` except at dimension :attr:`dim`, which is "
"replaced by two dimensions: ``(num_groups, max_group_size)``. Elements "
"are rearranged according to their group membership."
msgstr ""
"入力テンソルに1次元追加されたテンソルです。形状は\\ :attr:`x`\\ と同じですが、次元\\ :attr:`dim`\\ "
"は2つの次元に置き換えられます: ``(num_groups, max_group_size)``。要素はグループ所属に基づいて再配置されます。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.groupby.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.groupby.groupby:40
msgid "Example"
msgstr "使用例"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.groupby.groupby:42
msgid ""
">>> # Group a 1D tensor\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([10., 20., 30., 40., 50.])\n"
">>> group_id = torch.tensor([0, 1, 0, 1, 0])\n"
">>> grouped = QF.groupby(x, group_id)\n"
">>> grouped\n"
"tensor([[10., 30., 50.],\n"
"        [20., 40., nan]])"
msgstr ">>> # 1次元テンソルのグループ化\n>>> x = torch.tensor([10., 20., 30., 40., 50.])\n>>> group_id = torch.tensor([0, 1, 0, 1, 0])\n>>> grouped = QF.groupby(x, group_id)\n>>> grouped\ntensor([[10., 30., 50.],\n        [20., 40., nan]])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.groupby.groupby:50
msgid ""
">>> # Group along a specific dimension of 2D tensor\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[1., 2., 3., 4.],\n"
"...                   [5., 6., 7., 8.]])\n"
">>> group_id = torch.tensor([0, 1, 0, 2])\n"
">>> grouped = QF.groupby(x, group_id, dim=1)\n"
">>> grouped\n"
"tensor([[[1., 3.],\n"
"         [2., nan],\n"
"         [4., nan]],\n"
"\n"
"        [[5., 7.],\n"
"         [6., nan],\n"
"         [8., nan]]])"
msgstr ">>> # 2次元テンソルの特定の次元に沿ったグループ化\n>>> x = torch.tensor([[1., 2., 3., 4.],\n...                   [5., 6., 7., 8.]])\n>>> group_id = torch.tensor([0, 1, 0, 2])\n>>> grouped = QF.groupby(x, group_id, dim=1)\n>>> grouped\ntensor([[[1., 3.],\n         [2., nan],\n         [4., nan]],\n\n        [[5., 7.],\n         [6., nan],\n         [8., nan]]])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.groupby.groupby:64
msgid ""
">>> # Using custom empty value\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([1, 2, 3, 4, 5], dtype=torch.int)\n"
">>> group_id = torch.tensor([0, 0, 1, 1, 1])\n"
">>> grouped = QF.groupby(x, group_id, empty_value=-1)\n"
">>> grouped\n"
"tensor([[ 1,  2, -1],\n"
"        [ 3,  4,  5]], dtype=torch.int32)"
msgstr ">>> # カスタムの空値を使用\n>>> x = torch.tensor([1, 2, 3, 4, 5], dtype=torch.int)\n>>> group_id = torch.tensor([0, 0, 1, 1, 1])\n>>> grouped = QF.groupby(x, group_id, empty_value=-1)\n>>> grouped\ntensor([[ 1,  2, -1],\n        [ 3,  4,  5]], dtype=torch.int32)"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.groupby.groupby:72
msgid ":func:`group_shift`: Shift operation within groups."
msgstr ":func:`group_shift`: グループ内でのシフト演算。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.groupby.groupby:73
msgid ":func:`cumcount`: Number each occurrence of unique values."
msgstr ":func:`cumcount`: 一意な値の出現ごとに番号を付ける関数。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.groupby.groupby:74
msgid ":func:`bincount`: Count occurrences of each value."
msgstr ":func:`bincount`: 各値の出現回数を数える関数。"

